Cube Prompts — Whitecube prompt library

prompt_manager/ is the core of Prompt Manager Studio 0.2.0 (MIT License),
copied from ~/Projects/prompt-manager at commit 7882c40 and adapted for
Whitecube: app name and data paths, a private-file credential store when no OS
keyring runs, current Claude models, and no licence gating. app.py and
style.css are new and follow the Whitecube app style.
